1148: SLPI stage 3: in-kernel FastRPC client, the equivalent of `hexagonrpcd -d sdsp -s`, gated by bergamotaslpifrpc=1 (with bergamotaslpi=3).
On the fastrpcglink-apps-dsp channel (1146): INIT_ATTACH_SNS, remotectl open/register/close of adsp_default_listener, adsp_listener
init2, then the next2 loop serving the DSP's reverse calls: apps_std fopen_with_env/fread/fseek/fclose/stat/opendir/readdir/closedir
from the read-only ext4 volumes of 1147 (vendor etc/sensors, persist sensors/registry, dsp sdsp; synthetic /sys/devices/soc0 files),
remotectl open for apps_std/apps_mem; writes and apps_mem map requests are refused with AEE_EUNSUPPORTED and logged. The payloads live in
a 4 MiB heap at 0xe1000000 hyp-assigned HLOS+SSC_Q6 (returned to HLOS at teardown). Every call is logged. Requires 1137, 1141, 1142, 1146, 1147.

--- a/bsd/dev/beryllium_wlan.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/beryllium_wlan.c
